{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "9846a5b0039684ba5924cd6455a456348cc121d90877ac34d97995984688ceee", "ja": "雑誌の撮影　休憩中", "zh": "杂志拍摄　休息中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6000_place", "source_sha256": "d4791fb11477fe30ba4df1a8faada2b28b2b8855f65e1a06166ed650c671fc94", "ja": "公園", "zh": "公园", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6001_p", "source_sha256": "94dc2aabb91117a39609c377c1c4058f35069977961514b1a01bf365f680e640", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影がはじまった。\n少し席を外してしまったが、美希は大丈夫かな？）", "zh": "（写真杂志《爱格拉！！》的拍摄开始了。虽然刚才暂时离开了一会儿，美希没事吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6002_003mik", "source_sha256": "3e3bf9f6f5309f1cb6721227aee4a4e0a5694757f2ffe5b3c11e1808c90836ab", "ja": "{$P$}！　やっと戻ってきたの。\nもう撮影、半分終わっちゃったよ？", "zh": "{$P$}！你终于回来啦。\n拍摄都已经结束一半了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6003_003mik", "source_sha256": "e7c59a5c9ca08ee2f83a68cc78cc210efa9c957986db6a95b926708311c38664", "ja": "今日のミキ、絶好調ってカンジ！\n{$P$}にも見てほしかったな……。", "zh": "今天的美希，感觉状态超棒！也想让{$P$}看看呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6004_p", "source_sha256": "2a65c72c4c986ccf6332fad1ee678d6f8e431b23658c51782892c2bb4d1e2fa5", "ja": "そうだったのか。ごめんな、美希。\nどうしても外せない打ち合わせだったんだ。", "zh": "原来是这样。抱歉，美希。\n那是无论如何都不能缺席的会议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6005_003mik", "source_sha256": "d9c0ec1d2ad0cc668e78293304b38fdcd59d06608b485e999a2436a8103c313b", "ja": "む～……。ねえ、{$P$}？\nウサギは寂しいと死んじゃうって、聞いたの。", "zh": "唔～……呐，{$P$}？\n美希听说，兔子太寂寞的话可是会死掉的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6006_003mik", "source_sha256": "461dc752851196af849a0dfd2b79e161c97bc6223dcd737ac09d0e2a57c7e926", "ja": "でもね、ミキウサギは、もっと寂しがりやさんなん\nだって。……ああ～、もうすぐ死んじゃうかもなの。", "zh": "不过呢，听说美希兔兔更怕寂寞呢。……啊啊～，好像马上就要死掉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6007_p", "source_sha256": "2ef767b215dc4aaa52ec28e593b9494b5fb3c85938336a15f9cff59f4dee730d", "ja": "本当に、ひとりにして申し訳ない……。\n俺が居ない間、頑張ってくれてありがとな。", "zh": "真的很抱歉，把你一个人留在那里……  \n谢谢你在我不在的时候一直努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6008_003mik", "source_sha256": "fa81053233674db2a17efb139c5d98cd466184226684c27b4262e50b6b9cefb3", "ja": "そうなの。ミキ、すっごくがんばったの。\nがんばりすぎて、ちょっと疲れちゃった……。", "zh": "是这样。美希真的特别努力了。\n努力过头，稍微有点累了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6009_p", "source_sha256": "2dc44c052350096143773c3c6a3dcdf32747415271a104440b229419936ae558", "ja": "そ、そうか……。撮影を見られなかったお詫びに、\n何か埋め合わせをさせてくれないか？", "zh": "是、是吗……为了向没能去看拍摄道歉，能让我做点什么补偿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6010_003mik", "source_sha256": "b8c360ad8dd62effebfd3703db89a26d12d1f4e901d188d038611758bb96d800", "ja": "埋め合わせ……？\n{$P$}、どんなことしてくれるの？", "zh": "补偿……？\n{$P$}，你打算怎么补偿美希呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6011", "source_sha256": "dffb44ccada2bd9d403db269b312b6325150cb86342c7ed7801dcc5ec3f884dd", "ja": "美希を見る", "zh": "查看美希", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6012", "source_sha256": "9007090a12c1bad501c466ec956a6e9961c70df7196d89946d8a527b736760f9", "ja": "ご褒美を提案", "zh": "提议奖励", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6013", "source_sha256": "0b0205a10820eeb0ce59b6cc2e0eb94b38140301fc85dad30b66aa7089f5ddda", "ja": "ウサ耳をつける", "zh": "戴上兔耳朵", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6100_p", "source_sha256": "5c9bb8df0a78ed3192874ddf10504cc8a459def076e5ef99e635e48012f0380c", "ja": "この後の撮影は、ここを離れないようにするよ。\n美希のこと、ずっと見てるからな！", "zh": "接下来的拍摄，我会尽量不离开这里。\n因为我会一直看着美希！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6101_003mik", "source_sha256": "baaef927badbe15bf0dc3bb692f0355ccad355f0bb5ee0c467db4e3a4b459ce3", "ja": "！！　……今の、なんか告白みたいなの～！\nミキ、ちょっとだけキュンってしちゃった。", "zh": "！！……刚才那番话，听起来好像告白哦～！\n美希都有点心动了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6102_003mik", "source_sha256": "efed6e89cd5bbe3e2fb2dd37fa592b629caf6b93b8387c6fccd481798fe942fb", "ja": "それじゃハニー。撮影が終わるまで、よそ見禁止なの。\nずーっとミキだけ見ててね♪　あはっ☆", "zh": "那就这样，亲爱的。在拍摄结束之前，不许看别的地方哦。\n要一直看着美希才行♪ 啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6200_p", "source_sha256": "6900985819d98d92965153189789b4b409952e1cdd001c70c3300de02e3ccc5d", "ja": "そうだな。撮影が終わったら、動物園に行かないか？\n公園に併設されてて、人気スポットになってるらしい。", "zh": "是啊。拍摄结束后，要不要去动物园？\n听说动物园就在公园旁边，已经成了人气景点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6201_003mik", "source_sha256": "2e185d6e0ef8cb92f4fd46ddd56488a4e383ca8af6688d13694b8229636a3708", "ja": "それって、ご褒美デートってこと？\nうれしいの～！　ミキね、ウサギだっこしたいな。", "zh": "也就是说，这是奖励约会吗？\n好开心哦～！美希想抱抱兔子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6202_003mik", "source_sha256": "319bc8eb2efc81ca3a007d16d7693a84e4cab3d5e8f36a232c2b64cc947702e9", "ja": "あと、ミキと{$P$}とウサギの\nスリーショットも！　ミキ、すぐに撮影終わらせるね♪", "zh": "还有，美希要和{$P$}还有兔子\n拍三人合照！美希马上就把拍摄搞定哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6300_p", "source_sha256": "5a0ded06e9d1f946c8a8c9b776e5e498651989b3966f4917099e3814090a30d3", "ja": "わかった。お詫びとして、俺もウサ耳をつけるよ。\nこれで埋め合わせにならないか……？", "zh": "知道了。作为赔礼，我也戴上兔耳朵吧。\n这样能不能扯平呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6301_003mik", "source_sha256": "3faba0d7f2b7158a147c942c9521619bbd915569a0639f104643c73398f166ab", "ja": "んー、{$P$}がつけるの？\nミキとお揃いで、とってもかわいいの！　あははっ。", "zh": "嗯——，{$P$}要戴吗？\n跟美希戴一样的，非常可爱哦！啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_6302_003mik", "source_sha256": "1135b40a5cb9ad5f248eb81ee4fa7c8e4600ded485fed355a053eb542dc3beed", "ja": "でも、なんかお詫びっぽくないの。それならミキ、\n別のお詫びがいいな。お詫びデート楽しみにしてるね♪", "zh": "不过，总觉得这不太像道歉呢。那样的话，美希想要别的道歉。很期待补偿约会哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
